 "source": "package main\n\nfunc arithmetic(a, b, c, d, e int) int {\n\treturn a+b*c+d/e\n}\n\nfunc combined(a, b, c, d, e int) int {\n\treturn a*b+c/d-e%7\n}\n\nfunc shifts(a int) int {\n\treturn a<<4+a>>1\n}\n\nfunc bitwise(a, b, c int) int {\n\treturn a|b&c\n}\n\nfunc andNot(a, b int) int {\n\treturn a&^b\n}\n\nfunc comparison(a, b, c, d int) bool {\n\treturn a+b<c+d&&a!=0 // mixed precedence comparison\n}\n\nfunc unary(p *int) int {\n\treturn -*p\n}\n\nfunc address(x int) *int {\n\treturn &x\n}\n\nfunc not(ok bool) bool {\n\treturn !ok\n}\n",
